From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Banana Pi -BPI <lionwang@sinovoip.com.cn>
Date: Wed, 26 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] BPI-M5-Linux-eMMC-100MHz-HS200

部分 Banana Pi M5 批次搭配 Hynix eMMC 時，較高的 Meson eMMC
時序可能降低長時間讀寫與啟動穩定性。Linux 保留 HS200，但停用 HS400
並將控制器上限由 200 MHz 降為 100 MHz。

這項設定只覆寫 M5 板級 DTS，不影響尚未取得相同實機證據的 M2 Pro。

Signed-off-by: Banana Pi -BPI <lionwang@sinovoip.com.cn>
---
 .../boot/dts/amlogic/meson-sm1-bananapi-m5.dts | 6 ++++++
 1 file changed, 6 insertions(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/amlogic/meson-sm1-bananapi-m5.dts b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/amlogic/meson-sm1-bananapi-m5.dts
index 697855fec476..000000000000 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/amlogic/meson-sm1-bananapi-m5.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/amlogic/meson-sm1-bananapi-m5.dts
@@ -162,8 +162,14 @@ &cvbs_vdac_port {
 	cvbs_vdac_out: endpoint {
 		remote-endpoint = <&cvbs_connector_in>;
 	};
 };
 
+&sd_emmc_c {
+	/* Hynix 批次以保守的 HS200 時脈換取啟動與讀寫穩定性。 */
+	no-mmc-hs400;
+	max-frequency = <100000000>;
+};
+
 &frddr_a {
 	status = "okay";
 };
